; A GridMap whose billboarding tile casts onto a floor under a shadowed sun, in three cells along X.
; Each shadow falls from its own cell and faces the main camera, as Godot billboards every MultiMesh
; instance about its cell in the shadow pass (`material.cpp:1263-1264`). grid-map-billboard casts
; nothing, so a shadow that turns about the GridMap origin shows here and nowhere else.
